1
00:00:02,242 --> 00:00:04,442
(Penny:)Oh, hey, if you guys
are free this weekend,

2
00:00:04,444 --> 00:00:06,274
(Penny:)I won a night of
wine tasting from work.

3
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,780
(Leonard:)That sounds fun.
Mm-hmm.

4
00:00:07,781 --> 00:00:11,181
(Leonard:)How come scientists don't win
free stuff like salespeople do?

5
00:00:11,184 --> 00:00:12,854
'Cause we're not in it
for the stuff.

6
00:00:12,853 --> 00:00:15,553
(Howard:)We're in it
for the groupies.

7
00:00:15,556 --> 00:00:16,826
SHELDON:
Personally,

8
00:00:16,823 --> 00:00:19,623
(Sheldon:)I find the notion of
external rewards demeaning.

9
00:00:19,626 --> 00:00:22,926
(Sheldon:)I pursue science for the
intrinsic joy of discovery.

10
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:25,830
(Amy:)But you always say that
you want to win a Nobel Prize.

11
00:00:25,832 --> 00:00:28,302
(Sheldon:)I also say don't contradict
me in front of my friends,

12
00:00:28,302 --> 00:00:29,572
(Sheldon:)but that you
don't remember.

13
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:32,640
(Penny:)All right, well, let me know
if you guys want to go.

14
00:00:32,639 --> 00:00:33,839
(Raj:)I would love to.

15
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:36,980
(Raj:)I do enjoy the complexity
of an aged Pinot noir.

16
00:00:36,977 --> 00:00:38,277
(Leonard:)I'm sure that would pair nicely

17
00:00:38,278 --> 00:00:40,208
(Leonard:)with your fried nuggets
of chicken.

18
00:00:41,982 --> 00:00:44,082
(Amy:)Well, it sounds like
a nice night. We should go.

19
00:00:44,084 --> 00:00:45,154
(Sheldon:)Wine again?

20
00:00:45,152 --> 00:00:46,382
(Sheldon:)Yeah, no, thank you.

21
00:00:46,386 --> 00:00:48,286
(Sheldon:)I like my grapes
the old-fashioned way:

22
00:00:48,288 --> 00:00:50,618
(Sheldon:)in a juice box.

23
00:00:50,624 --> 00:00:51,994
(Amy:)Well, I'm going.

24
00:00:51,992 --> 00:00:53,992
(Amy:)You couldn't stop me from
getting a massage at the mall,

25
00:00:53,994 --> 00:00:55,664
(Amy:)and you're not stopping me now.

26
00:00:55,662 --> 00:00:57,432
(Sheldon:)I shouldn't have to
see my girlfriend

27
00:00:57,431 --> 00:00:59,261
(Sheldon:)get groped in public
by another man.

28
00:00:59,266 --> 00:01:01,836
(Amy:)And I shouldn't
have to see my boyfriend

